                <invention-title lang="en">SYSTEMS, METHODS AND BITSTREAM STRUCTURE FOR HYBRID FEATURE VIDEO BITSTREAM AND DECODER</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A method of and a decoder for decoding a video-based machine video signal is provided. Encoded feature data, and signaling information for the encoded feature data, is received. The signaling information for the feature data includes a sequence level feature parameter set and a picture level feature parameter set, and the signaling information further includes information relating to a scale factor for resolution change and location information identifying the location of at least one region of interest in the encoded feature data. The feature data is decoded in response to the signaling information including the sequence level feature parameter set and the picture level feature parameter set, and the decoded feature data is output to a machine video application.</p>
            </abstract>
